WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.080
Aloha means both farewell and greetings, and Hawaii bids farewell to 40 years of frustration

00:10.080 --> 00:14.960
and failure in attempts to win statehood, and joyously greets its new status as a full-fledged

00:14.960 --> 00:17.480
member of the union, its 50th state.

00:17.480 --> 00:21.760
It's a banner occasion for the islands which will rank as the 47th state and area, midway

00:21.760 --> 00:24.080
between New Jersey and Connecticut.

00:24.080 --> 00:29.200
The United States border is now within 3900 miles of Tokyo, land of the hola of sugar

00:29.200 --> 00:34.440
cane and pineapple, with its polyglot population, brings a colorful culture as its heritage

00:34.440 --> 00:35.840
and contribution.

00:35.840 --> 00:40.640
Perhaps most important of all, Hawaiian statehood gives the lie to communist charges of American

00:40.640 --> 00:41.640
colonialism.

00:41.640 --> 00:59.680
A big day was a long time in coming, which means that much more to celebrate.

